I tend to wish for blessed magic marker (99) over and over: then just dip
scrolls in water and you can get about four or five scrolls off each marker:
make one of them a scroll of charging, use it on the marker and keep going. 

I tend to write scrolls of genocide (one game I genocided L,V,D,c,N,n,l,X,U,T,H
and a few others I can't remember - nearly ran out of food!).  This makes the
wizard much less powerful - if you genocide his favourite monsters then you can
concentrate on killing him rather than fending off assorted uglies while he
nicks the amulet off you.  Other useful scrolls would be enchant armour,
enchant weapon, charging (for the marker or that dud WOW you're lugging
around).

The reason why you ask for a blessed marker is that: if you write a scroll on
uncursed paper with uncursed marker, you get uncursed scroll.  If you use a
blessed marker, it bumps the scroll up to blessed.

I occasionally wish for cursed markers: use them to write genocide scrolls and
then summon wraiths then nurses to make a very strong character.

